   194	/// Outbound module dependencies of `file`: distinct target files reached by a
   195	/// resolved cross-file call (`source: PrismCpg`), plus extracted-but-unresolved
   196	/// imports labeled `UnresolvedImport` (`source: HeuristicImport`). Spec §10.
